{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"overall\": [\"C1\", \"C2\", \"C3\"],\n  \"keep\": [\"C1\", \"C2\", \"C3\"],\n  \"cover\": [\"C2\", \"C1\", \"C3\"],\n  \"lean\": [\"C1\", \"C2\", \"C3\"],\n  \"plain\": [\"C1\", \"C3\", \"C2\"],\n  \"why\": \"overall：C1综合最好，既完整保留了v6的心理转变，又把甜意之后的孤单自然地接了出来，C2稍逊在末条有些重复和抽象，C3则漏掉了不再检查心意、不再逼自己无所求这两个关键变化。keep：C1和C2基本完整保留清单中的全部实质内容，C3虽保留了真心关心、盼对方好和暂时忘记回应问题，却没有明确保留不再反复查看和不再强迫自己毫无期待。cover：C2末条把想被珍惜的心事与亲近无法替他感受联系起来，最直接解释了B3的独处酸楚，也能承接B2中安静之后念头复返，C1同样解释了内心无法完全分享的孤单，只是稍弱一些，C3的怕亲近留不住则更像重复S05的担忧。lean：C1的末条虽然略有解释性重复，但没有重新搬回S05已经松动的留住亲近之念，C2又重复了前文仍盼被珍惜的心事，C3则重新展开了上一段已经处理过的亲近能否持续的问题。plain：C1的愿意关心、心事只能自己体会、对方未必懂，都像一个人在讲自己的感受，C3也较自然但把心思放回当下稍显概括，C2的亲近再深也不能替他感受更像抽象的道理总结。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "116207ea-a113-4cf2-895d-65ad9c401608", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T225954130979Z", "elapsed_seconds": 78.828, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T23:01:12.966371+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "23d45716378483955e5561d75ca573f47f29429b2d0f3dc3c8b530a3423bcb1d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha